SUMMARY:A Night by the Fire with Jo-Anne Driessens
DESCRIPTION:Presented by State Library to coincide with our Through Mununja
 li eyes exhibition currently on display\, a powerful tribute to Mununjali 
 photojournalist Wayne Coolwell and his legacy.Join us and enjoy the heat o
 f the campfire\, while listening to Wayne's friend and colleague\, Jo-Anne
  Driessens\, share memories of him\, and what his work means for the futur
 e generations.Come along to listen\, learn\, and share.Light refreshments 
 will be provided.
LOCATION:State Library of Queensland\, Stanley Place\, South Bank
URL:https://www.slq.qld.gov.au/whats-on/night-fire-jo-anne-driessens
